  "name": "PressurePads",
  "slug": "pressurepads",
  "teaser": "No more swapping between flashlight and laser, manage them independently with hotkeys.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/h9nf7El2OKFOLWuoqvEmucCr2ZVilLhcG3bIKKX6.png",
  "downloads": 5022,
  "favourites_count": 18,
  "description": "<h1>PressurePads</h1>\n<p>Enables independently managing tactical devices. Toggle and switch modes on your flashlights, lasers, and illuminators with ease. No more switching between flashlight and laser. Turn them both on and off at will.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Toggle tactical devices independently with two customizable hotkeys (light/laser)</li>\n<li>Switch modes on devices separately with <code>modifier + hotkey</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Control Modes</h3>\n<p><strong>Standard Mode</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Click hotkey to toggle device</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Advanced Mode</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hold key for momentary activation</li>\n<li>Double-tap to toggle device</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Known Issues</h2>\n<p>If using with Fika, the click animation will play regardless of what you set in the config. This is due to an issue inside Fika which should hopefully be fixed soon!</p>\n<h2>Contact</h2>\n<p>Feel free to ping me on discord @ajdj100 or leave a comment if you need to get a hold of me!</p>\n<h2>Installation (thanks DrakiaXYZ for the gif)</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n",
